"structures. \n"
" No grouping, healing, reviving or clans with Lawful players. \n"
" Certain kills against protected Lawful players reduce Alignment. \n"
"  \n"
" RETURNING TO LAWFUL \n"
"  \n"
" Reach Alignment > 0, then pray at a church."

